{"3791670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crafters Heaven", "steam_appid": 3791670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafters Heaven</strong> — Your Ultimate Lowpoly RPG Sandbox Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant lowpoly world where creativity meets survival. Explore vast landscapes, craft powerful tools, and build your dream sanctuary in this immersive RPG sandbox adventure. Whether you’re battling wild creatures, exploring mysterious dungeons, or gathering resources, every step is a new challenge and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Roam freely across beautifully crafted lowpoly environments filled with secrets and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> Manage your health, hunger, and stamina while facing dynamic weather and dangerous wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System:</strong> Gather resources and craft weapons, armor, tools, and building materials to thrive and defend yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Elements:</strong> Level up your skills, customize your character, and embark on quests that shape your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Creativity:</strong> Build and customize your base with endless possibilities — from cozy cabins to mighty fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Awaits:</strong> Discover hidden dungeons, solve puzzles, and unlock the mysteries of Crafters Heaven.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner crafter, survive the wilderness, and carve your own path in this enchanting lowpoly world. Are you ready to build your heaven?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafters Heaven</strong> — Your Ultimate Lowpoly RPG Sandbox Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant lowpoly world where creativity meets survival. Explore vast landscapes, craft powerful tools, and build your dream sanctuary in this immersive RPG sandbox adventure. Whether you’re battling wild creatures, exploring mysterious dungeons, or gathering resources, every step is a new challenge and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Roam freely across beautifully crafted lowpoly environments filled with secrets and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mechanics:</strong> Manage your health, hunger, and stamina while facing dynamic weather and dangerous wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System:</strong> Gather resources and craft weapons, armor, tools, and building materials to thrive and defend yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Elements:</strong> Level up your skills, customize your character, and embark on quests that shape your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Creativity:</strong> Build and customize your base with endless possibilities — from cozy cabins to mighty fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Awaits:</strong> Discover hidden dungeons, solve puzzles, and unlock the mysteries of Crafters Heaven.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner crafter, survive the wilderness, and carve your own path in this enchanting lowpoly world. Are you ready to build your heaven?</p>", "short_description": "Crafters Heaven is a lowpoly RPG sandbox where you design and build your own items piece by piece. Create unique weapons, tools and equipment, build your base, fight wild creatures, and explore an open world full of secrets! Demo coming soon!", "supported_languages": "English", "hea